WEBVTT

00:00:01.133 --> 00:00:03.750
♪ Gentle music ♪
Everyone plays pickleball now.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.250
Pensioners.

00:00:03.967 --> 00:00:06.167
Maureen: Is this the one who cried?

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:07.200
Doreen: Not yet, dear.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.517
Tech bros.

00:00:07.383 --> 00:00:09.583
Juanma: Is that bread a string or a number?

00:00:09.417 --> 00:00:10.950
Darren: C'est du pain.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.267
A dog.

00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:13.267
His owner: Where's your other ball?

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:14.317
Biscuit: Buried.

00:00:14.317 --> 00:00:15.817
A retired dentist.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.700
Gerald: Tell me if I'm ever wrong.

00:00:16.717 --> 00:00:18.917
Glenda: That one was in, Gerald.

00:00:18.933 --> 00:00:21.067
Gerald: That's not what I asked.

00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:22.383
Aliens.

00:00:21.183 --> 00:00:23.383
Zorp: Take me to your dinker.

00:00:23.883 --> 00:00:26.083
Blip: Is that your good knee?

00:00:26.317 --> 00:00:28.567
A sea monster.

00:00:28.683 --> 00:00:30.883
The Monster: I ate the last lighthouse. It was lovely.

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:33.433
So bring an anvil.

00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:34.567
Brenda, the umpire: Is that allowed? Oh.

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:37.200
Ruling: The anvil is permitted.

00:00:36.733 --> 00:00:37.200
Brenda, the umpire: Very nice. Point.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.833
[Crowd roars]

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.517
Or a piano.

00:00:38.217 --> 00:00:39.833
Brad: Nope.

00:00:39.833 --> 00:00:41.150
Or throw your paddle.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.400
Ruling: That was your partner.

00:00:53.567 --> 00:00:56.567
Every loss costs a knee. You have three.

00:00:56.567 --> 00:01:00.317
A man in a visor will pay cash for your good knee.

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:02.567
He has brought a cooler.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:05.567
Pensioners.

00:01:03.583 --> 00:01:05.567
Doreen: I've counted your stitches.

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:07.067
One more game?

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:07.767
Your knees have gone.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:08.933
Ruling: Permitted.

00:01:08.933 --> 00:01:16.433
Pickleball against pensioners, tech bros, aliens and a sea monster. Bring an anvil. A roguelite. Coming to Steam, iOS and Android.
